# ============================================================================
# JARVIS Android AI Assistant — Environment & API Key Template (.env.example)
# ============================================================================
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# 1. NEVER commit your real API keys to GitHub or source control.
# 2. The actual `.env` file is ignored via `.gitignore`.
# 3. Recommended way on Android phone:
#    After installing `JARVIS-debug.apk` or `JARVIS-release.apk`, open the app ->
#    go to `Settings -> AI Provider & Gemini Model Configuration` ->
#    enter your Gemini / OpenAI / DeepSeek / OpenRouter API key directly in the app.
#    It is stored locally on your device using Android DataStore and sent via
#    the `x-goog-api-key` HTTP header.
# ============================================================================

# Optional build-time placeholders (Keep commented unless using Secrets Gradle Plugin):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE
# OPENAI_API_KEY=YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY_HERE
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=YOUR_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY_HERE
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY_HERE
